{"id":"b82cea6742372d50","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-pcf.md","title":"Possible Cofinalities","display":"df-pcf — Possible Cofinalities","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-pcf","aliases":["58-df-pcf"],"display":"df-pcf — Possible Cofinalities","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-pcf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-pcf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pcf — Possible Cofinalities"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a32c3b00cffaa99\" href=\"?note=5a32c3b00cffaa99\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> (set of regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}\\)</span> (cardinal predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\)</span> (ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md\">../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> (集合基数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\\)</span> (约化积 true-cofinality 谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5a32c3b00cffaa99\" href=\"?note=5a32c3b00cffaa99\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}\\)</span> (本文件定义的 possible-cofinalities 运算)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf}\\vdash\n\\left(A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\min A\\right)\n\\to\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\lambda\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\exists U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\n\\bigl(A,\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U,\\lambda\\bigr)\\right)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pcf}\\vdash\n\\left(A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in A\\;\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land|A|&lt;\\min A\\right)\n\\to\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\lambda\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\n\\exists U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S\n\\bigl(A,\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U,\\lambda\\bigr)\\right)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>PCF 研究正则基数集的约化积可能具有的 true cofinalities。</li>\n<li>对超滤子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U\">\\(\\mathcal P(A)\\setminus U\\)</span> 是其对偶理想；true cofinality 由书内三参数谓词直接判定，不再误把普通序数 cofinality 当作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{tcf}\\)</span> 的来源。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span> 一般不必是有限集；原文件的“finite”断言错误。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-ultrafilter.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e8